    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d400">

                <pb facs="0308" n="236" xml:id="pg236"/>

                <head>Municipal Council of Hamilton, Canada West</head>
                <dateline>
                    <placeName>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Mayor’s Office, <placeName>Hamilton, C.
                                W.</placeName></hi></placeName>, <lb/>
                    <date calendar="gregorian" when="1865-04-26"><hi rendition="#italic">April 26,
                            A. D. 1865</hi></date>.</dateline>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor, by direction of the
                    municipal corporation of the city of Hamilton, Canada West, to enclose a copy of
                    resolutions passed by that body on hearing the sad news of the assassination of
                    the late President, Abraham Lincoln, and to respectfully request that you will
                    be pleased to lay the same before the President.</p>
                <p>I have the honor to be, sir, your most obedient servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>CHARLES MAGILL,</signed>
                    <lb/>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mayor of Hamilton, C. W</hi>.</closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Hon. <hi rendition="#small-caps"> William H. Seward</hi>, <lb/>
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Secretary of State</hi>.</p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
